{"2026_September_28":{"parse":{"title":"Portal:Current events/2026 September 28","pageid":84338829,"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1372288606\">.mw-parser-output .current-events-main{margin:0.5em 0;padding:0.3em;background-color:var(--background-color-base,#fff);color:inherit;border:1px #cef2e0 solid}.mw-parser-output .current-events-heading{background-color:#cef2e0;color:inherit;font-weight:bold}@media screen{html.skin-theme-clientpref-night .mw-parser-output .current-events-main{border-color:#0b281a}html.skin-theme-clientpref-night .mw-parser-output .current-events-heading{background-color:#0b281a}}@media screen and (prefers-color-scheme:dark){html.skin-theme-clientpref-os .mw-parser-output .current-events-main{border-color:#0b281a}html.skin-theme-clientpref-os .mw-parser-output .current-events-heading{background-color:#0b281a}}.mw-parser-output .current-events-title{padding:0.4em}.mw-parser-output .current-events-navbar{list-style:none;margin:0;font-size:small}.mw-parser-output .current-events-navbar li{display:inline-block;padding:0 0.4em}.mw-parser-output .current-events-content{padding:0 0.3em}.mw-parser-output .current-events-content-heading{margin-top:0.3em;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .current-events-more{border-width:2px;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;padding:0.3em 0.6em}.mw-parser-output .current-events-nav{margin:auto;text-align:center;line-height:1.2}.mw-parser-output .current-events-nav a{display:inline-block;margin:0.5em;padding:0.5em;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#eaecf0)}.mw-parser-output .current-events-nav a>div{font-weight:bold}@media all and (min-width:480px){.mw-parser-output .current-events-heading{align-items:center;display:flex}.mw-parser-output .current-events-title{flex:1}.mw-parser-output .current-events-navbar{flex:0 auto;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap}.mw-parser-output .current-events-nav{max-width:22em}.mw-parser-output .current-events-nav a{width:9em}}</style><div class=\"current-events\">\n<div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"September 28\" id=\"2026&#95;September&#95;28\" class=\"current-events-main vevent\">\n    <div class=\"current-events-heading plainlinks\">\n        <div class=\"current-events-title\" role=\"heading\"><span class=\"summary\">September&#160;28,&#160;2026<span style=\"display: none;\">&#160;(<span class=\"bday dtstart published updated itvstart\">2026-09-28</span>)</span> (Monday)</span>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"current-events-navbar editlink noprint\"><li><a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Portal:Current_events/2026_September_28&amp;action=edit&amp;editintro=Portal:Current_events/Edit_instructions\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Portal:Current_events/2026_September_28&amp;action=edit&amp;editintro=Portal:Current_events/Edit_instructions\">edit</a></li><li><a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Portal:Current_events/2026_September_28&amp;action=history\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Portal:Current_events/2026_September_28&amp;action=history\">history</a></li><li><a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Portal:Current_events/2026_September_28&amp;action=watch\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Portal:Current_events/2026_September_28&amp;action=watch\">watch</a></li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"current-events-content description\">\n<p><b>Armed conflicts and attacks</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Somali_Civil_War_(2009%E2%80%93present)\" title=\"Somali Civil War (2009–present)\">Somali Civil War</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Constitutional_crisis_in_Somalia\" title=\"Constitutional crisis in Somalia\">Constitutional crisis in Somalia</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Controversies_of_Hassan_Sheikh_Mohamud\" title=\"Controversies of Hassan Sheikh Mohamud\">Controversies of Hassan Sheikh Mohamud</a>\n<ul><li>At least 23 people are killed and others are injured as heavy clashes breaks out across the <a href=\"/wiki/South_West_State_of_Somalia\" title=\"South West State of Somalia\">South West State of Somalia</a>, as forces loyal to <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_leaders_of_South_West_State_of_Somalia\" title=\"List of leaders of South West State of Somalia\">former president</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Abdiaziz_Laftagareen\" title=\"Abdiaziz Laftagareen\">Abdiaziz Laftagareen</a> launch a major armed assault on troops of <a href=\"/wiki/Aden_Madobe\" title=\"Aden Madobe\">Aden Madobe</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Hassan_Sheikh_Mohamud\" title=\"Hassan Sheikh Mohamud\">Hassan Sheikh Mohamud</a>. The assault starts with gunfire, explosive drones and a suicide vehicle bomb, spreading through the regional capital <a href=\"/wiki/Baidoa\" title=\"Baidoa\">Baidoa</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.garoweonline.com/en/news/somalia/heavy-fighting-erupts-in-somalia-s-baidoa-as-rival-south-west-forces-clash\">(Garowe Online)</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://horseedmedia.net/somalia-heavy-fighting-reported-in-baidoa-as-rival-sides-claim-gains/425975/\">(Horseed Media)</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.bluewin.ch/en/news/at-least-23-killed-in-clashes-in-southwest-somalia-li.3616998\">(Bluewin)</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Russo-Ukrainian_war_(2022%E2%80%93present)\" title=\"Russo-Ukrainian war (2022–present)\">Russo-Ukrainian war</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Kyiv_strikes_(2022%E2%80%93present)\" title=\"Kyiv strikes (2022–present)\">Kyiv strikes</a>\n<ul><li>At least 24 people, including the former secretary of the <a href=\"/wiki/National_Security_and_Defence_Council_of_Ukraine\" title=\"National Security and Defence Council of Ukraine\">National Security and Defence Council</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Volodymyr_Horbulin\" title=\"Volodymyr Horbulin\">Volodymyr Horbulin</a>, are injured and three are killed by <a href=\"/wiki/Unmanned_Systems_Forces_of_Russia\" title=\"Unmanned Systems Forces of Russia\">Russian drone</a> strikes on the <a href=\"/wiki/National_Academy_of_Sciences_of_Ukraine\" title=\"National Academy of Sciences of Ukraine\">National Academy of Sciences of Ukraine</a> building, a health clinic, and a residential building in <a href=\"/wiki/Kyiv\" title=\"Kyiv\">Kyiv</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ukraine\" title=\"Ukraine\">Ukraine</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/28/russia-strike-on-kyiv-science-academy-drone-ukraine\">(<i>The Guardian</i>)</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.pravda.com.ua/eng/news/2026/09/28/8055496/\">(<i>Ukrainska Pravda</i>)</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Polish_military\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Polish military\">Polish military</a> jets are scrambled in response to <a href=\"/wiki/Russian_Air_Force\" title=\"Russian Air Force\">Russian</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Airstrike\" title=\"Airstrike\">airstrikes</a> on Ukraine. Individuals in <a href=\"/wiki/Lublin_Voivodeship\" title=\"Lublin Voivodeship\">Lublin Voivodeship</a> are briefly urged to seek shelter before an alert is lifted. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.reuters.com/world/poland-tells-people-east-take-shelter-russia-strikes-ukraine-2026-09-28/\">(Reuters)</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<p><b>Business and economy</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/President_of_Russia\" title=\"President of Russia\">Russian president</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Vladimir_Putin\" title=\"Vladimir Putin\">Vladimir Putin</a> places <a href=\"/wiki/Germany\" title=\"Germany\">German</a> retailer <a href=\"/wiki/Metro_AG\" title=\"Metro AG\">Metro AG</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Economy_of_Russia\" title=\"Economy of Russia\">Russian assets</a> under temporary administration, removing Metro's operational control amid broader <a href=\"/wiki/Russia\" title=\"Russia\">Russian</a> restrictions on businesses from countries it classifies as <a href=\"/wiki/Unfriendly_countries_list\" title=\"Unfriendly countries list\">unfriendly</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://apnews.com/article/russia-kremlin-metro-germany-ukraine-3c9e1ffc85eec2a448ca2dbc2ef4147b\">(AP)</a></li></ul>\n<p><b>Disasters and accidents</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/2026_Bangkok_floods\" title=\"2026 Bangkok floods\">2026 Bangkok floods</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Flood\" title=\"Flood\">Flooding</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Landslide\" title=\"Landslide\">landslides</a> kill at least eight people each in <a href=\"/wiki/Myanmar\" title=\"Myanmar\">Myanmar</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Thailand\" title=\"Thailand\">Thailand</a>, while 20 to 30 people remain missing in <a href=\"/wiki/Tanintharyi_Region\" title=\"Tanintharyi Region\">Tanintharyi Region</a> and more than 1.7 million people across <a href=\"/wiki/Bangkok\" title=\"Bangkok\">Bangkok</a> and 27 <a href=\"/wiki/Thai_provinces\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Thai provinces\">Thai provinces</a> are affected. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.france24.com/en/live-news/20260928-tolls-mount-in-thailand-myanmar-floods\">(AFP via France 24)</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Eighty-one people in <a href=\"/wiki/Uttar_Pradesh\" title=\"Uttar Pradesh\">Uttar Pradesh</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/India\" title=\"India\">India</a>, and 21 more in <a href=\"/wiki/Nepal\" title=\"Nepal\">Nepal</a> are killed during heavy floods and landslides in the past three days. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.euronews.com/2026/09/28/at-least-62-killed-after-heavy-rain-and-flooding-in-northern-india-officials-say\">(Euronews)</a></li>\n<li>An <a href=\"/wiki/Avalanche\" title=\"Avalanche\">avalanche</a> kills at least two <a href=\"/wiki/Mountaineering\" title=\"Mountaineering\">climbers</a> and leaves 14 others missing at the <a href=\"/wiki/Base_camp\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Base camp\">base camp</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/Himalayas\" title=\"Himalayas\">Himalayan</a> mountain <a href=\"/wiki/Nemjung\" title=\"Nemjung\">Nemjung</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Manang_District,_Nepal\" title=\"Manang District, Nepal\">Manang District</a>, Nepal, as heavy snowfall hampers rescue operations. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://gulfnews.com/world/asia/two-dead-14-missing-after-avalanche-on-nepals-himlung-peak-1.500690178\">(AFP via <i>Gulf News</i>)</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cwjdvml9e897o\">(BBC News)</a></li></ul>\n<p><b>Science and technology</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Starship_flight_14\" title=\"Starship flight 14\">Starship flight 14</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/SpaceX\" title=\"SpaceX\">SpaceX</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/SpaceX_Starship\" title=\"SpaceX Starship\">Starship</a> Flight 14 launches into orbit from <a href=\"/wiki/Starbase,_Texas\" title=\"Starbase, Texas\">Starbase</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Texas\" title=\"Texas\">Texas</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/United_States\" title=\"United States\">United States</a>. However, it also returns early to <a href=\"/wiki/Earth\" title=\"Earth\">Earth</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/9/28/spacexs-showpiece-starship-rocket-reaches-orbit-for-first-time\">(Al Jazeera)</a><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://apnews.com/article/spacex-starship-orbit-262d3c58d56bf7a525b49115d6c5dfe8\">(AP)</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"current-events-nav\" role=\"navigation\">\n        <div><a href=\"/wiki/Portal:Current_events/September_2026\" title=\"Portal:Current events/September 2026\">Month<div>September 2026</div></a></div><a href=\"/wiki/Portal:Current_events/2026_September_27\" title=\"Portal:Current events/2026 September 27\">Previous day<div>September 27</div></a><a href=\"/wiki/Portal:Current_events/2026_September_29\" title=\"Portal:Current events/2026 September 29\">Next day<div>September 29</div></a></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐api‐ext.codfw.main‐5f6d9f959b‐l7xw7\nCached time: 20260929001259\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 781/1000000\nRevision size: 4297/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 4282/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 263/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 14/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1908/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1203519/52428800 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 0/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   50.986      1 -total\n 99.91%   50.941      2 Template:Current_events\n 37.31%   19.021      1 Template:Start_date\n 17.31%    8.828      4 Template:Extract\n 13.79%    7.029     10 Template:MONTHNAME\n  7.89%    4.022     10 Template:MONTHNUMBER\n  4.59%    2.339      1 Template:Main_other\n-->\n\n<!-- Render ID 87080ae1-bb9a-11f1-80c0-f3fb1b9ae7d4 -->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key enwiki:pcache:84338829:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20260929001259 and revision id 1377336292. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}},"2026_September_27":{"parse":{"title":"Portal:Current events/2026 September 27","pageid":84330674,"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1372288606\">.mw-parser-output .current-events-main{margin:0.5em 0;padding:0.3em;background-color:var(--background-color-base,#fff);color:inherit;border:1px #cef2e0 solid}.mw-parser-output .current-events-heading{background-color:#cef2e0;color:inherit;font-weight:bold}@media screen{html.skin-theme-clientpref-night .mw-parser-output .current-events-main{border-color:#0b281a}html.skin-theme-clientpref-night .mw-parser-output .current-events-heading{background-color:#0b281a}}@media screen and (prefers-color-scheme:dark){html.skin-theme-clientpref-os .mw-parser-output .current-events-main{border-color:#0b281a}html.skin-theme-clientpref-os .mw-parser-output .current-events-heading{background-color:#0b281a}}.mw-parser-output .current-events-title{padding:0.4em}.mw-parser-output .current-events-navbar{list-style:none;margin:0;font-size:small}.mw-parser-output .current-events-navbar li{display:inline-block;padding:0 0.4em}.mw-parser-output .current-events-content{padding:0 0.3em}.mw-parser-output .current-events-content-heading{margin-top:0.3em;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .current-events-more{border-width:2px;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;padding:0.3em 0.6em}.mw-parser-output .current-events-nav{margin:auto;text-align:center;line-height:1.2}.mw-parser-output .current-events-nav a{display:inline-block;margin:0.5em;padding:0.5em;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#eaecf0)}.mw-parser-output .current-events-nav a>div{font-weight:bold}@media all and (min-width:480px){.mw-parser-output .current-events-heading{align-items:center;display:flex}.mw-parser-output .current-events-title{flex:1}.mw-parser-output .current-events-navbar{flex:0 auto;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap}.mw-parser-output .current-events-nav{max-width:22em}.mw-parser-output .current-events-nav a{width:9em}}</style><div class=\"current-events\">\n<div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"September 27\" id=\"2026&#95;September&#95;27\" class=\"current-events-main vevent\">\n    <div class=\"current-events-heading plainlinks\">\n        <div class=\"current-events-title\" role=\"heading\"><span class=\"summary\">September&#160;27,&#160;2026<span style=\"display: none;\">&#160;(<span class=\"bday dtstart published updated itvstart\">2026-09-27</span>)</span> (Sunday)</span>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"current-events-navbar editlink noprint\"><li><a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Portal:Current_events/2026_September_27&amp;action=edit&amp;editintro=Portal:Current_events/Edit_instructions\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Portal:Current_events/2026_September_27&amp;action=edit&amp;editintro=Portal:Current_events/Edit_instructions\">edit</a></li><li><a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Portal:Current_events/2026_September_27&amp;action=history\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Portal:Current_events/2026_September_27&amp;action=history\">history</a></li><li><a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Portal:Current_events/2026_September_27&amp;action=watch\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Portal:Current_events/2026_September_27&amp;action=watch\">watch</a></li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"current-events-content description\">\n<p><b>Armed conflicts and attacks</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Yemeni_civil_war_(2014%E2%80%93present)\" title=\"Yemeni civil war (2014–present)\">Yemeni civil war</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Houthi%E2%80%93Saudi_Arabian_conflict\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Houthi–Saudi Arabian conflict\">Houthi–Saudi Arabian conflict</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/2026_Yemen_offensives\" title=\"2026 Yemen offensives\">2026 Yemen offensives</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Saudi_Arabia\" title=\"Saudi Arabia\">Saudi Arabia</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Royal_Saudi_Air_Force\" title=\"Royal Saudi Air Force\">air forces</a> carry out an <a href=\"/wiki/Airstrike\" title=\"Airstrike\">airstrike</a> at a market in <a href=\"/wiki/Taiz\" title=\"Taiz\">Taiz</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Yemen\" title=\"Yemen\">Yemen</a>, killing seven people and wounding 40 more. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.reuters.com/world/middle-east/seven-people-killed-strike-market-yemen-houthi-run-health-ministry-says-2026-09-27/\">(Reuters)</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Russo-Ukrainian_war_(2022%E2%80%93present)\" title=\"Russo-Ukrainian war (2022–present)\">Russo-Ukrainian war</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Attacks_in_Russia_during_the_Russo-Ukrainian_war_(2022%E2%80%93present)\" title=\"Attacks in Russia during the Russo-Ukrainian war (2022–present)\">Attacks in Russia during the Russo-Ukrainian war</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Kyiv_strikes_(2022%E2%80%93present)\" title=\"Kyiv strikes (2022–present)\">Kyiv strikes</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Odesa_strikes_(2022%E2%80%93present)\" title=\"Odesa strikes (2022–present)\">Odesa strikes</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Zaporizhzhia_strikes_(2022%E2%80%93present)\" title=\"Zaporizhzhia strikes (2022–present)\">Zaporizhzhia strikes</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Russian_Armed_Forces\" title=\"Russian Armed Forces\">Russian</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Armed_Forces_of_Ukraine\" title=\"Armed Forces of Ukraine\">Ukrainian forces</a> exchange strikes that kill at least eight people in <a href=\"/wiki/Ukraine\" title=\"Ukraine\">Ukraine</a> and one in <a href=\"/wiki/Russia\" title=\"Russia\">Russia</a>, hitting <a href=\"/wiki/Kyiv\" title=\"Kyiv\">Kyiv</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Kyiv_Oblast\" title=\"Kyiv Oblast\">its outskirts</a>; the <a href=\"/wiki/Kharkiv_Oblast\" title=\"Kharkiv Oblast\">Kharkiv</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Odesa_Oblast\" title=\"Odesa Oblast\">Odesa Oblasts</a>; <a href=\"/wiki/Sumy\" title=\"Sumy\">Sumy</a>; and <a href=\"/wiki/Russian_occupation_of_Ukraine\" title=\"Russian occupation of Ukraine\">Russian-occupied</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Enerhodar\" title=\"Enerhodar\">Enerhodar</a>, all in Ukraine; and Russia's <a href=\"/wiki/Belgorod_Oblast\" title=\"Belgorod Oblast\">Belgorod Oblast</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://apnews.com/article/russia-ukraine-war-germany-drones-strikes-f91ac88ee287bad2a3c99d2608975f53\">(AP)</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Russian_strikes_against_Ukrainian_infrastructure\" title=\"Russian strikes against Ukrainian infrastructure\">Russian strikes against Ukrainian infrastructure</a>\n<ul><li>Russian strikes hit <a href=\"/wiki/Kyivstar\" title=\"Kyivstar\">Kyivstar</a>'s headquarters and multiple <a href=\"/wiki/Data_centre\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Data centre\">data centres</a> in Kyiv, including a facility struck twice that injures two children and an adult. Russia also says it targeted a <a href=\"/wiki/Vodafone_Ukraine\" title=\"Vodafone Ukraine\">Vodafone Ukraine</a> data centre. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.indiatoday.in/world/story/russia-ukraine-strikes-largest-mobile-provider-kyivstar-hq-vodafone-data-centre-kyiv-3004342-2026-09-27\">(<i>India Today</i>)</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/2026_Afghanistan%E2%80%93Pakistan_war\" title=\"2026 Afghanistan–Pakistan war\">2026 Afghanistan–Pakistan war</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Islamic_State%E2%80%93Taliban_conflict\" title=\"Islamic State–Taliban conflict\">Islamic State–Taliban conflict</a>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Afghan_Armed_Forces\" title=\"Afghan Armed Forces\">Afghan Armed Forces</a> kill 28 fighters allegedly linked to the <a href=\"/wiki/Islamic_State_%E2%80%93_Khorasan_Province\" title=\"Islamic State – Khorasan Province\">Islamic State</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Nuristan_Province\" title=\"Nuristan Province\">Nuristan Province</a>. The <a href=\"/wiki/Ministry_of_Defense_(Afghanistan)\" title=\"Ministry of Defense (Afghanistan)\">Minister of Defense</a> reports that the gunmen entered from <a href=\"/wiki/Pakistan\" title=\"Pakistan\">Pakistan</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.aljazeera.com/amp/news/2026/9/27/afghanistan-says-28-fighters-killed-as-islamabad-kabul-trade-accusations\">(Al Jazeera)</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ethiopian_civil_conflict_(2018%E2%80%93present)\" title=\"Ethiopian civil conflict (2018–present)\">Ethiopian civil conflict</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/2026_Ethiopian_offensive\" title=\"2026 Ethiopian offensive\">2026 Ethiopian offensive</a>\n<ul><li>A <a href=\"/wiki/Drone_warfare\" title=\"Drone warfare\">drone</a> strikes <a href=\"/wiki/Tigrai_Television\" title=\"Tigrai Television\">Tigrai Television</a>'s headquarters in <a href=\"/wiki/Mekelle\" title=\"Mekelle\">Mekelle</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Tigray_Region\" title=\"Tigray Region\">Tigray Region</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ethiopia\" title=\"Ethiopia\">Ethiopia</a>, forcing the <a href=\"/wiki/Mass_media_in_Ethiopia\" title=\"Mass media in Ethiopia\">station</a> off air, while <a href=\"/wiki/Tigray_People%27s_Liberation_Front\" title=\"Tigray People&#39;s Liberation Front\">Tigray People's Liberation Front</a> forces capture <a href=\"/wiki/Erebti_(woreda)\" title=\"Erebti (woreda)\">Erebti</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Afar_Region\" title=\"Afar Region\">Afar Region</a>, and advance toward <a href=\"/wiki/Afdera_(woreda)\" title=\"Afdera (woreda)\">Afdera</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.france24.com/en/live-news/20260927-tigray-tv-station-hit-by-drone-rebels-advance-in-north-ethiopia\">(AFP via France 24)</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n<p><b>Business and economy</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Turkish_economic_crisis_(2018%E2%80%93current)\" title=\"Turkish economic crisis (2018–current)\">Turkish economic crisis</a>\n<ul><li>Former <a href=\"/wiki/Ministry_of_Family_and_Social_Services\" title=\"Ministry of Family and Social Services\">Turkish family minister</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Fatma_Bet%C3%BCl_Sayan_Kaya\" title=\"Fatma Betül Sayan Kaya\">Fatma Betül Sayan Kaya</a> resigns from her positions in the ruling <a href=\"/wiki/Justice_and_Development_Party\" title=\"Justice and Development Party\">Justice and Development Party</a> amid scrutiny over alleged links to an <a href=\"/wiki/Investment_fund\" title=\"Investment fund\">investment-fund</a> scandal that prompted the <a href=\"/wiki/Capital_Markets_Board_of_Turkey\" title=\"Capital Markets Board of Turkey\">Capital Markets Board</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Liquidate\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Liquidate\">liquidate</a> 131 funds and led to 51 arrests. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.afp.com/de/node/3843873\">(AFP)</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://apnews.com/article/turkey-kaya-akp-erdogan-shares-fund-resigns-17bde38ae6bd04c7b6f66da3c7e4bdec\">(AP)</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<p><b>Disasters and accidents</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>A bus carrying <a href=\"/wiki/Philippines\" title=\"Philippines\">Filipino</a> tourists veers off a <a href=\"/wiki/Highway\" title=\"Highway\">highway</a> near <a href=\"/wiki/Munich\" title=\"Munich\">Munich</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Germany\" title=\"Germany\">Germany</a>, killing two people and wounding 25 more. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://apnews.com/article/germany-philippines-tourists-bus-crash-b32abd29e5b2c05aef1d285ac8636fc7\">(AP)</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.democrata.es/en/international/two-deceased-and-dozens-of-injured-when-a-bus-of-filipino-tourists-overturned-in-southern-germany/amp/\">(<i>Demócrata</i>)</a></li></ul>\n<p><b>International relations</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/China%E2%80%93United_States_relations\" title=\"China–United States relations\">China–United States relations</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Panda_diplomacy\" title=\"Panda diplomacy\">Panda diplomacy</a>\n<ul><li>Two giant pandas, <a href=\"/wiki/Ping_Ping_and_Fu_Shuang\" title=\"Ping Ping and Fu Shuang\">Ping Ping and Fu Shuang</a>, arrive at <a href=\"/wiki/Zoo_Atlanta\" title=\"Zoo Atlanta\">Zoo Atlanta</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Georgia_(U.S._state)\" title=\"Georgia (U.S. state)\">Georgia</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/United_States\" title=\"United States\">U.S.</a>, as part of an agreement signed between <a href=\"/wiki/China\" title=\"China\">China</a> and the U.S. during <a href=\"/wiki/Paramount_leader\" title=\"Paramount leader\">Chinese leader</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Xi_Jinping\" title=\"Xi Jinping\">Xi Jinping</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/2026_state_visit_by_Xi_Jinping_to_the_United_States\" title=\"2026 state visit by Xi Jinping to the United States\">state visit</a> last week. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.dawn.com/news/2033172/two-giant-pandas-sent-by-china-arrive-in-us\">(AFP via <i>Dawn</i>)</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://apnews.com/article/china-pandas-atlanta-zoo-trump-xi-jingping-ff3ac033385997ac4d07a8a5c9c2f9bb\">(AP)</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n<p><b>Law and crime</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/2026_RAF_Fairford_arrests\" title=\"2026 RAF Fairford arrests\">2026 RAF Fairford arrests</a>\n<ul><li>Five men are arrested in relation to a 'major incident' at <a href=\"/wiki/RAF_Fairford\" title=\"RAF Fairford\">RAF Fairford</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Royal_Air_Force_station\" title=\"Royal Air Force station\">air base</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/England\" title=\"England\">England</a>. They are arrested on suspicion of committing offences that violate the <a href=\"/wiki/Explosives_Act_1875\" title=\"Explosives Act 1875\">Explosives Act 1875</a> and preparation of a terrorist act. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://edition.cnn.com/2026/09/27/uk/fairford-arrests-uk-raf-us-intl\">(CNN)</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/sep/27/major-incident-declared-near-raf-fairford-as-men-arrested-on-suspicion-of-explosives-offences\">(<i>The Guardian</i>)</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Crime_in_South_Africa\" title=\"Crime in South Africa\">Crime in South Africa</a>\n<ul><li>Ten people are killed and 11 others are injured in a <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_mass_shootings_in_South_Africa\" title=\"List of mass shootings in South Africa\">mass shooting</a> at a store in <a href=\"/wiki/Lwandle\" title=\"Lwandle\">Lwandle</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/City_of_Cape_Town\" title=\"City of Cape Town\">City of Cape Town</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/South_Africa\" title=\"South Africa\">South Africa</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/South_African_Police_Service\" title=\"South African Police Service\">Police</a> search for the perpetrators. A <a href=\"/wiki/Business\" title=\"Business\">business</a> dispute is suspected to be the main motive. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.euronews.com/2026/09/27/two-mass-shootings-in-south-africa-leave-at-least-27-dead\">(Euronews)</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Three people are killed and four more injured in a <a href=\"/wiki/Mass_shootings_in_the_United_States\" title=\"Mass shootings in the United States\">mass shooting</a> after an altercation at a <a href=\"/wiki/Strip_club\" title=\"Strip club\">strip club</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Detroit\" title=\"Detroit\">Detroit</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Michigan\" title=\"Michigan\">Michigan</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/United_States\" title=\"United States\">United States</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.aljazeera.com/amp/news/2026/9/27/three-killed-four-injured-in-shooting-at-detroit-michigan-strip-club\">(Al Jazeera)</a></li></ul>\n<p><b>Politics and elections</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/2026_French_Senate_election\" title=\"2026 French Senate election\">2026 French Senate election</a>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/National_Rally\" title=\"National Rally\">National Rally</a> clears the 10-seat threshold in the <a href=\"/wiki/Senate_(France)\" title=\"Senate (France)\">Senate</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/France\" title=\"France\">France</a>, allowing the <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_political_parties_in_France\" title=\"List of political parties in France\">party</a> to meet qualifications to form a <a href=\"/wiki/Far-right_politics_in_France\" title=\"Far-right politics in France\">far-right</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Parliamentary_group\" title=\"Parliamentary group\">parliamentary group</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/28/french-election-2026-far-right-senate-elections\">(<i>The Guardian</i>)</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.rfi.fr/en/france/20260927-far-right-gains-ground-in-french-senate\">(RFI)</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/2026_S%C3%A3o_Tom%C3%A9an_parliamentary_election\" title=\"2026 São Toméan parliamentary election\">2026 São Toméan parliamentary election</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/S%C3%A3o_Tom%C3%A9_and_Pr%C3%ADncipe\" title=\"São Tomé and Príncipe\">São Toméans</a> vote to elect 55 members of the <a href=\"/wiki/National_Assembly_(S%C3%A3o_Tom%C3%A9_and_Pr%C3%ADncipe)\" title=\"National Assembly (São Tomé and Príncipe)\">National Assembly</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://macaubusiness.com/jobs-and-youth-exodus-dominate-sao-tome-election/\">(AFP via <i>Macau Business</i>)</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/2026_Serbian_parliamentary_election\" title=\"2026 Serbian parliamentary election\">2026 Serbian parliamentary election</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/President_of_Serbia\" title=\"President of Serbia\">Serbian president</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Aleksandar_Vu%C4%8Di%C4%87\" title=\"Aleksandar Vučić\">Aleksandar Vučić</a> resigns in order to run for <a href=\"/wiki/Prime_Minister_of_Serbia\" title=\"Prime Minister of Serbia\">prime minister</a> in the upcoming <a href=\"/wiki/National_Assembly_(Serbia)\" title=\"National Assembly (Serbia)\">parliamentary</a> election. <a href=\"/wiki/President_of_the_National_Assembly_of_Serbia\" title=\"President of the National Assembly of Serbia\">Speaker of the National Assembly</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ana_Brnabi%C4%87\" title=\"Ana Brnabić\">Ana Brnabić</a> becomes <a href=\"/wiki/Acting_president\" title=\"Acting president\">acting president</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.reuters.com/world/europe/serbias-president-vucic-resigns-paving-way-early-elections-2026-09-27/\">(Reuters)</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/2026_Swiss_referendums\" title=\"2026 Swiss referendums\">2026 Swiss referendums</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Swiss_people\" title=\"Swiss people\">Swiss</a> voters reject an initiative that proposed to enshrine a stricter form of <a href=\"/wiki/Swiss_neutrality\" title=\"Swiss neutrality\">Swiss neutrality</a>, which would have prevented <a href=\"/wiki/Switzerland\" title=\"Switzerland\">Switzerland</a> from imposing <a href=\"/wiki/Economic_sanctions\" title=\"Economic sanctions\">economic sanctions</a> and cooperating with <a href=\"/wiki/NATO\" title=\"NATO\">NATO</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.reuters.com/world/swiss-vote-tightening-neutrality-rules-ending-peacetime-cooperation-with-nato-2026-09-27/\">(Reuters)</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<p><b>Sports</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/2026_Berlin_Marathon\" title=\"2026 Berlin Marathon\">2026 Berlin Marathon</a>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Berlin_Marathon\" title=\"Berlin Marathon\">Berlin Marathon</a> is held in <a href=\"/wiki/Germany\" title=\"Germany\">Germany</a>, with <a href=\"/wiki/Guye_Adola\" title=\"Guye Adola\">Guye Adola</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Tigst_Assefa\" title=\"Tigst Assefa\">Tigst Assefa</a> winning their respective marathon races although Assefa sustained cramps prior to the finish line. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://apnews.com/article/berlin-marathon-world-record-assefa-adola-f037a7546b40afce0df1eab1c9294691\">(AP)</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.bbc.com/sport/athletics/articles/c6rr4y59n0r0o\">(BBC News)</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/2026_Billie_Jean_King_Cup_finals\" title=\"2026 Billie Jean King Cup finals\">2026 Billie Jean King Cup finals</a>\n<ul><li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Tennis\" title=\"Tennis\">tennis</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Czech_Republic_Billie_Jean_King_Cup_team\" title=\"Czech Republic Billie Jean King Cup team\">Czech Republic</a> wins its 12th <a href=\"/wiki/Billie_Jean_King_Cup\" title=\"Billie Jean King Cup\">Billie Jean King Cup</a> title and first since 2018 after defeating <a href=\"/wiki/Ukraine_Billie_Jean_King_Cup_team\" title=\"Ukraine Billie Jean King Cup team\">Ukraine</a> 2–0 in the final in <a href=\"/wiki/Shenzhen\" title=\"Shenzhen\">Shenzhen</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Guangdong\" title=\"Guangdong\">Guangdong</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/China\" title=\"China\">China</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.afp.com/en/czech-republic-beat-ukraine-win-bjk-cup-0\">(AFP)</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/2026_UCI_Road_World_Championships\" title=\"2026 UCI Road World Championships\">2026 UCI Road World Championships</a>\n<ul><li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Cycle_sport\" title=\"Cycle sport\">cycling</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Brandon_McNulty\" title=\"Brandon McNulty\">Brandon McNulty</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/United_States\" title=\"United States\">United States</a> wins the men's road race world title in <a href=\"/wiki/Montreal\" title=\"Montreal\">Montreal</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Canada\" title=\"Canada\">Canada</a>, becoming the first American champion in 33 years after finishing 13 seconds ahead of <a href=\"/wiki/Australia\" title=\"Australia\">Australia</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Michael_Matthews_(cyclist)\" title=\"Michael Matthews (cyclist)\">Michael Matthews</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.afp.com/en/stunned-mcnulty-wins-miracle-road-race-world-title\">(AFP)</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"current-events-nav\" role=\"navigation\">\n        <div><a href=\"/wiki/Portal:Current_events/September_2026\" title=\"Portal:Current events/September 2026\">Month<div>September 2026</div></a></div><a href=\"/wiki/Portal:Current_events/2026_September_26\" title=\"Portal:Current events/2026 September 26\">Previous day<div>September 26</div></a><a href=\"/wiki/Portal:Current_events/2026_September_28\" title=\"Portal:Current events/2026 September 28\">Next day<div>September 28</div></a></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐api‐ext.codfw.canary‐9bf99d67c‐xw748\nCached time: 20260929010647\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.068 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.086 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 781/1000000\nRevision size: 9008/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 4282/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 263/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 14/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1908/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.009/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1203520/52428800 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 0/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   54.224      1 -total\n 99.87%   54.151      2 Template:Current_events\n 31.27%   16.956      1 Template:Start_date\n 20.69%   11.221      4 Template:Extract\n 11.35%    6.153     10 Template:MONTHNAME\n  6.56%    3.558     10 Template:MONTHNUMBER\n  2.23%    1.210      1 Template:Main_other\n-->\n\n<!-- Render ID 0b11bf57-bba2-11f1-a2aa-05f81d02116f -->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key enwiki:pcache:84330674:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20260929010647 and revision id 1377343540. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}}}